WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,200
The thread alone is not enough

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:14,910
We need to connect a well to a well.

3
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:16,630
If something comes from here, move it to the line

4
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:17,910
The balance above will be broken

5
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:20,550
Those dead branches and stones will fall without making any sound and

6
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:26,900
The falling debris may also cause a little disturbance to the madman. At least it can let us know which direction we are coming from and take turns to rest.

7
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:27,820
Team of two

8
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:28,860
Change every hour

9
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,140
Yu Hui and I will take charge first

10
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,060
keep quiet

11
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,300
Try to regain your strength

12
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,220
We can stay here for three hours at most

13
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:38,670
Do you have anything to eat?

14
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:40,270
Finished eating early

15
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,510
There is still a little water
